OL,3,CKing plants royal rose as he begins
OL,4,Csummer break in Scotland
OL,6,FIt is not the first time the King has
OL,7,Fadded to gardens. In August 2005,
OL,8,FCharles and Camilla ` then the Duke
OL,9,Fand Duchess of Rothesay ` planted two
OL,10,Fsycamore trees at the front of the
OL,11,Fcastle.
OL,13,FThe King's Rose has also been planted
OL,14,Fat The King's Foundation sister sites
OL,15,F` Dumfries House in East Ayrshire and
OL,16,FHighgrove Gardens in Gloucestershire.
OL,18,FThe Castle and Gardens of Mey was one
OL,19,Fof the beloved residences of the Queen
OL,20,FMother, who purchased the castle in
OL,21,F1952.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/3
