OL,3,CKing plants royal rose as he begins
OL,4,Csummer break in Scotland
OL,6,FIt is now managed and run by The
OL,7,FKing's Foundation, which oversees a
OL,8,Frange of green spaces with personal
OL,9,Fsignificance to the King.
OL,11,FThe Queen Mother typically spent three
OL,12,Fweeks at the castle in August each
OL,13,Fyear and the King, who has visited
OL,14,Ffrom a young age, has continued this
OL,15,Ftradition.
OL,17,FThe Castle and Gardens of Mey will
OL,18,Fopen to the public for tours from
OL,19,FWednesday August 12.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/3
